[{"id":5321726522,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPTMaOg","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?u=a27600b43b5278ada0f7abc144fcb1b615bdef8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The Variant code itself looks good. \n\nI do have one *concern* per-se: why are so many codepaths going through `Variant` to convert `TypedArray<T>` into `Vector<T>` ? This feels like a very convoluted and potentially expensive approach, especially considering `TypedArray` (well technically `Array`) uses a `Vector<Variant>` to store its members. \nSimilarly, the `Vector<String>` -> `Vector<StringName>` explicitely using `Variant` too instead of per-element conversion in `editor_properties.cpp`...","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123834#pullrequestreview-5321726522","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123834","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123834#pullrequestreview-5321726522"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123834"}},"subm